---
// OurStorySection.astro - Editorial Brand Heritage & Artisan Philosophy
---

<section id="story" class="store-width py-16 sm:py-24 scroll-mt-24 sm:scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#30251F]/10">
  <div class="space-y-16">
    <!-- Header with Editorial Serif Styling -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#9E4A2B]/10 border border-[#9E4A2B]/20 rounded-full text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#9E4A2B] uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>✦</span>
        <span>The Rablo Philosophy & Origins</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-medium text-[#30251F] tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
        In a world of fast algorithms,<br />
        <em class="font-serif italic font-normal text-[#9E4A2B]">we champion the patient hand.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#685950] leading-relaxed font-sans max-w-2xl">
        Rablo was created to rescue authentic craftsmanship from the noise of commoditized e-commerce, offering a direct bridge between discerning buyers and independent Instagram artisans.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Narrative & Split Imagery -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 sm:gap-14 items-center">
      <!-- Story Narrative Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#685950] leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-3xl space-y-4 shadow-soft-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-medium text-[#30251F] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#9E4A2B] font-mono text-base font-bold">01.</span>
            The Problem: The Algorithmic Toll Booth
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#685950] leading-relaxed">
            Every day across India, master ceramicists fire clay in small kilns, crochet artists spend twelve continuous hours forming bespoke knitwear, and painters detail delicate botanicals on cotton rag. Yet when they attempt to sell online, traditional mega-marketplaces demand 25% to 35% commission fees, impose algorithmic penalties, and bury their authentic work beneath mass-manufactured drop-shipped knockoffs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-3xl space-y-4 shadow-soft-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-medium text-[#30251F] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#9E4A2B] font-mono text-base font-bold">02.</span>
            Our Answer: Direct-to-DM Decentralized Commerce
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#685950] leading-relaxed">
            We asked ourselves a simple question: <em>What if discovery had zero toll booths?</em> Rablo operates with a strict <strong>0% take-rate policy</strong>. When you discover an artist here, we route you straight into their Instagram DM. You converse directly with the creator, request custom dimensions, select yarn shades, and settle payments directly via UPI. No checkout lock-in, no escrow fees, and no corporate intermediary taking a slice of an artist's livelihood.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Editorial Visual Showcase -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="relative group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#30251F]/10 shadow-soft-lg bg-[#EFE9DF] p-3">
          <div class="aspect-4/5 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544717305-2782549b5136?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"
              alt="Artisan working meticulously in studio"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#30251F]/90 via-[#30251F]/30 to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-6 text-[#FAF6F0]">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D9A37B] mb-1">
                Authentic Craftsmanship
              </span>
              <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-[#FAF6F0]">
                "Every stitch, glaze, and brushstroke carries the soul of its maker."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Stats Badge Strip -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-2xl text-center">
            <span class="block font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#30251F]">0%</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-[#685950] font-medium">Platform Fee Forever</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-2xl text-center">
            <span class="block font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#30251F]">100%</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-[#685950] font-medium">Creator Retained Profit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Guiding Core Pillars -->
    <div class="space-y-6 pt-4">
      <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-2">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-[#9E4A2B]">Guiding Values</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-medium text-[#30251F]">
          The Four Pillars of Rablo
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#685950]">
          How we preserve the integrity of slow-crafted commerce.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-3xl space-y-3 shadow-soft-sm hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#9E4A2B]/10 text-[#9E4A2B] flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">
            01
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-medium text-base text-[#30251F]">
            Zero Platform Tax
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#685950] leading-relaxed">
            Creators take home every single rupee they charge. By routing leads straight to Instagram and UPI, we eliminate payment gateway deductions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-3xl space-y-3 shadow-soft-sm hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#637B58]/10 text-[#637B58] flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">
            02
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-medium text-base text-[#30251F]">
            Direct Human Touch
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#685950] leading-relaxed">
            No faceless support bots. When you buy through Rablo, you speak with the artist directly, fostering relationships and custom bespoke requests.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-3xl space-y-3 shadow-soft-sm hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#D9A37B]/20 text-[#9E4A2B] flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">
            03
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-medium text-base text-[#30251F]">
            Manual Curation
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#685950] leading-relaxed">
            Every creation on Rablo is reviewed by real humans. We verify Instagram activity, review craftsmanship authenticity, and filter out low-grade replicas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#30251F]/10 rounded-3xl space-y-3 shadow-soft-sm hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#30251F]/10 text-[#30251F] flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm">
            04
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-medium text-base text-[#30251F]">
            Slow Living Focus
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#685950] leading-relaxed">
            We celebrate pieces made to last generations—from stoneware ceramics and archival botanical resin to hand-knitted cardigans that tell a story.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Artisan Manifesto Quote Box -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 bg-[#30251F] text-[#FAF6F0] rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden shadow-soft-lg">
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
        <span class="text-[#D9A37B] font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">
          ✦ The Artisan Manifesto
        </span>
        <blockquote class="font-serif italic text-lg sm:text-2xl text-[#FAF6F0] leading-relaxed">
          "Art is not something that should be cheapened by algorithms or stripped of its maker's identity. When you buy handmade, you're buying hundreds of hours of failed attempts, experimentation, and pure devotion."
        </blockquote>
        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-[#FAF6F0]/60">
          <span class="text-[#FAF6F0] font-medium">The Rablo Collective</span> · Dedicated to the Independent Creators of India
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -right-12 -bottom-12 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-[#9E4A2B]/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -left-12 -top-12 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-[#637B58]/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
